# Berserk: "Cast this spell only before the combat damage step" (CR 601.3) and "gains trample and gets +X/+0". Embereth
# Shieldbreaker (2/1) attacks and Bot2's Ornithopter (0/2) blocks it. Cast in the declare blockers step, after the block
# (still before combat damage - the positive control), Berserk makes it a 4/1 trampler: 2 damage is lethal to the
# Ornithopter and the other 2 reach Bot2 (CR 702.19b). In the combat damage step a second Berserk is refused. The
# Shieldbreaker attacked, so it is destroyed at the end step.

